			<div class="content" id="post-content-2776662">
									

<p>If you're gonna do a scip with a compulsion effect, it's gonna be a tough sell unless you do something nobody's seen before, because compulsion effects are cliché nowadays. Unfortunately, this doesn't strike me as very interesting or memorable. It's cheese that makes you want cheese, and then makes you make cheese. And then you eat cheese till you die. Sorry, -1.</p>
<p>P.S. You also committed my pet peeve: you've misused the word &quot;brackish.&quot; Don't know why that bugs me but it does. ;)</p>

