			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2778446">
									

<p>Neither of those hooks are particularly new. See <a href="/scp-2680">SCP-2680</a> for a recent example of the first and&#8230; I mean, just about any fifthist or factory skip for the second. There's no real depth to Terrance farms, except that the cheeses keep showing up, basically just making it a ticking clock component.</p>
<p>Not that there being depth to Terrance farms would have saved this for me.</p>
<p>It's not even the only cheese skip, we've got the pun -J at the least.</p>
<p>This is an old, tired story. It's very well written, but not exceptionally so. It would have to be something spectacular, or at least with a substantial twist, for me to upvote something like this.</p>
<p>-1</p>

